  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 10 | Circuit Overview
    explanation: 'Two 5-V voltage dividers share the same switched positive bus and
      ground. LEFT: upper 220 Ohm, lower 330 Ohm. RIGHT: upper 100 Ohm, lower 150
      Ohm. LCD senses MID A minus MID B; no conductive cross-link.'
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | CIRCUIT TOPOLOGY
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.5}
      label: 5 V DC
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.3, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: switch
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.27, y: 0.82}
      label: SW1
