  - title: LEVEL 10 | Wiring Guide
    explanation: Battery+ -> switch; switch output -> upper LEFT and RIGHT resistors;
      each upper resistor -> its own midpoint; each midpoint -> corresponding lower
      resistor; both lowers -> Battery_negative. LCD A -> MID A; LCD B -> MID B.
      Do not use LCD as a return wire.
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | STEP-BY-STEP CONNECTIONS
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.5}
      label: 5 V DC
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.3, b: 0.4, a: 1}
