  - title: LEVEL 10 | Electrical Concept
    explanation: 'Nominal: LEFT midpoint = 5*330/(220+330)=3.00 V; RIGHT midpoint
      = 5*150/(100+150)=3.00 V; differential approximately 0 V. The diagram labels
      show the Level 10 source configuration, not the solved Level 20 resistor values.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | NOMINAL ELECTRICAL RESULTS
